{
  "id": "moor_bram_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Turf stacked by the thousand under a long open shed, scales, and a book on a stand that has been in that spot a very long time."
        },
        {
          "text": "“By the thousand or by the load. The book stays here.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_bram_count",
          "text": "How many have come out of the deep cut?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "moor_cut_count"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_library",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "moor_bram_count_told",
            "onFailure": "moor_bram_count_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "moor_bram_swapped",
          "text": "Were the forty-one put back the ones that came out?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "moor_cut_swapped"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                17,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_library",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "moor_bram_swapped_told",
            "onFailure": "moor_bram_swapped_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_bram_count_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Forty-one.” Bram does not have to check and does not pretend to. “Since we started counting, which is my great-grandfather.” He turns the stand slightly, not enough to show you the page. “And forty-one put back. That is in there too. The Library takes them, the Library measures them, the Library sends them home, and we put them back where they came from.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "moor_cut_count"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_bram_count_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_bram_count_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_library",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_bram_count_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_bram_swapped_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "It takes him a long moment. “No,” he says. “Two of them are written up different going in to coming out. Different height on one. Different hands on the other — *hands*, written just like that.” He shuts the book. “My grandfather's hand, in among the weights and the dates, like it was a Tuesday.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "moor_cut_swapped"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_bram_swapped_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_bram_swapped_wont",
      "says": [
